# Visitors' conduct aboard an NPC ship: a gun out, and theft.
wg-crew-conduct-brandish-warn = Put that weapon away. You have ten seconds.
wg-crew-conduct-brandish-complied = Good. Keep it that way.
wg-crew-conduct-brandish-hostile = That's it. Take them down!
wg-crew-conduct-haul-warn = Put our crewman down. You have ten seconds.
wg-crew-conduct-haul-complied = Leave them. Our medics will see to them.
wg-crew-conduct-haul-hostile = They're taking our people! Take them down!
wg-crew-conduct-theft = Thief! Put that back!
